Z||000011||Phil||11-09-2000||10:08 PM||||If you bought it from a dealer you have an implied warranty( usually 30 days) but if you got it from a private seller in the "as is" condition you have no recourse.||||reg||1
Z||000012||BigBoyToys||11-09-2000||10:27 PM||||Hey, Nice looking GT with great potential and <BR>decent wheels!<BR>Does the car still have the Catalytic Converter installed? Couldn't a blocked Cat cause these similar symptoms? <BR>I wouldn't part it out just yet.<BR>Get it to someone with good diagnostic skills.<BR>Good Luck,<BR>BBTs<BR>||||reg||1
